# Pin LF for text in the index AND the working tree, as sdv-internal-refs does.
#
# The specs here are byte-identical mirrors of sdv-internal-refs, and its
# tests/test_*_spec.py compare the two WORKING-TREE files byte for byte. With
# plain `text=auto`, a Windows checkout writes CRLF here while internal-refs
# (eol=lf) writes LF, so the asa/mls/nwsl/on3 mirror tests failed locally even
# though the committed blobs were identical.
* text=auto eol=lf
